OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe cloud
OL,6,Fthickening with patchy rain at times
OL,7,Fduring this evening and overnight,
OL,8,Fskies then clearing by dawn and
OL,9,Fturning rather chilly. Fresh northwest
OL,10,Fwinds developing over the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells, although there will
OL,14,Fbe isolated showers. Light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,17,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,18,Fpressure dominates. Mostly cloudy in
OL,19,Fthe east on Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,20,Fpatchy light rain or showers possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
